# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository is PUBLIC. Anything committed here is visible to anyone, and
# it stays in the git history even after you delete the file.
#
# GitHub Pages on a free account only serves public repositories, so switching
# the repo to private would take pasteluxvn.com offline. The defence is
# therefore not to commit sensitive material in the first place.
#
# Never commit:
#   - API keys or tokens.  ANTHROPIC_API_KEY lives in Actions Secrets, which is
#     never exposed even on a public repo — keep it there.
#   - Client drawings, tender documents, fee proposals.
#   - Photographs you do not hold the rights to publish.
#
# Anything to keep locally but out of the repo goes in private/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
private/
*.dwg
*.rvt
*.pln
**/draft-*/
